---
title: AdviseCare - Sequence Diagram SD-01 - Import Accounts
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ADM as System Administrator
    participant W as Web App
    participant C as AccountsController
    participant S as AccountService
    participant X as IExcelReader
    participant R as IGenericRepository
    participant DB as SQL Server
    ADM->>W: Upload accounts.xlsx
    W->>C: POST /api/Accounts/import (multipart file)
    C->>S: ImportAsync(request)
    S->>X: Read rows (email, fullName, userName, facultyCode, role, studentCode, academicStatus)
    X-->>S: rows
    S->>R: Load faculties, roles, existing emails, usernames and student codes
    R->>DB: SELECT
    DB-->>R: rows
    R-->>S: reference data
    S->>S: Validate every row (required fields, formats, duplicates in file and system, 5 or 7 filled columns)
    alt any row is invalid
        S-->>C: ImportAccountResponse (invalid rows, nothing created)
        C-->>W: 200 OK with the invalid rows
    else all rows valid
        S->>R: PrepareCreate Account, AccountRole and StudentProfile for each row (linkStatus = notLinked, no password)
        S->>R: SaveAsync()
        R->>DB: INSERT (one transaction)
        S->>S: Log activity accountsImported
        S-->>C: ImportAccountResponse (created accounts)
        C-->>W: 200 OK
        W-->>ADM: Show result and offer to send linking emails
    end
